     <p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">各位老师：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">依照上级文件要求，</span>20</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">24</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">年教师资格定期注册工作已启动。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">一</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">、注册对象</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; text-indent: 32px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">本次参加注册的对象为</span><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 16px;">201</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">9</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">年</span>12<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">月及以前注册今年到期</span></span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">的老师（</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">请各位老师</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">务必</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">查看本人教师资格证注册贴上的有效期，如今年到期或者已经过期，则请及时与学校教科室联系</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">）以及</span><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">尚未注册过的教师</span></strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">（要求必须有一年以上的培训学分，</span>202</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">4</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">年新教师等到明年再进行注册）。</span>201</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">9</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">年之后注册或已定期注册的老师暂不参加本次注册（注册有效期到期当年会另行安排）</span></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">  经筛查，尚未注册的老师名单如下：</span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">  </span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">王青</span></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">二</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">、申请注册人员请于</span><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">202</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">4</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">年</span>10<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">月</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">1</span></span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">4</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">日</span>-1</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">6</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">日</span></strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">登录</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">“</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">中国教师资格网</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">”</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">http://www.jszg.edu.cn</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"> </span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">建议使用谷歌浏览器或</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">360</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">安全浏览器的极速模式</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">)<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">教师资格定期注册网上申报栏目，进行实名注册、网上申报、提交申请、打印《教师资格定期注册申请表》一式</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">2</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">份，并于</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">10<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">月</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">18</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">日前</span></span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">提交</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">相关材料，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">具体</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">包括：</span></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">①</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">《教师资格定期注册申请表》打印，</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">手写签名</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">一式</span>2<span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">份；</span></span></strong></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">②</span></strong><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">《教师资格证书》原件。</span></strong></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span></strong></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">三、报名前需要重新注册一次。注册时请注意信息要完整、正确。上传的照片必须是证件照。具体操作步骤和常见问题解决办法详见</span><strong><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">附件</span>1</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">申请人必读</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">）</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">。</span></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 7px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">附件</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">1</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">：</span></span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/10/202410121357397228.pdf" title="202410121357397228.pdf" style="color: rgb(0, 102, 204); font-size: 16px; text-decoration: underline;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">202410121357397228.pdf</span></a></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">
</span></p><p style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: "Times New Roman";"> </span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">本次需要参与注册的教师名单如下</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">（若有遗漏，请于</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">10.14</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">前与教科室联系）</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">：</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">高一年段：以下老师的所有材料交至高一年段管委会何誉文老师</span></strong></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">陈炳炉、丁雪艳、盛婷婷、王芳、杨炀、陈龙珠、陈雪萍、戴华敏、丁金美、丁泾芳、丁嫣然、何凯、洪波、胡唯亚、金华元、孔祥新、郦章华、刘晓牛、楼立青、马丹娜、孟伟强、彭爱波、沈初见、沈祥土、唐海燕、童莉芳、王法新、王海燕、王洁、王姗姗、王燕、王玉宇、谢月明、邢婷、严淇、杨大为、杨国仁、杨晶晶、杨佩琼、俞苗锋、俞霞、俞一凡、张江、张叶、钟慧军、周冰、方建平</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;"> </span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">高二年段：以下老师的所有材料交至高二年段管委会裘洪萍老师</span></strong></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.5em;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">韩冰</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;">、</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">张坚秋</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51